# Count this project's real source files in GitHub language stats.
# Linguist classifies SQL and YAML as "data" and excludes them by default;
# here the dbt models, semantic layer, eval suite, and profiles ARE source.
dbt/**/*.sql linguist-detectable
dbt/**/*.yml linguist-detectable
src/tender_radar/semantic/*.yaml linguist-detectable
evals/*.yaml linguist-detectable
profiles/*.yaml linguist-detectable
